- Improvement Guidance1: Develop an automatic backup mechanism that stores copies of the archived notes (e.g., before writing to `archived_notes.txt`). This could involve creating a temporary backup file before any changes are made to the notes file or maintaining a version history.
- Error Analysis2: This test explicitly calls for unimplemented backup functionality.
- Improvement Guidance2: Implement essential features such as data backup and restoration to enhance data integrity. Define explicit requirements around data handling in project specifications to ensure all essential functionalities are covered.

